            "url": "/noam-ai/native/G8-T53/b/figures/q2_head.svg",
            "sha256": "b4e73f5103840af26791cdbcee228baac5cea7975d6972ec5672738bbe1780fa"
          },
          "answer": "$3·2 ^2·7=84$ סמ״ק."
